      "message": "Hi,William\n\nThanks very much for the new patchsets!\nI didn\u0027t know that the function ble_vnd_is_included defined in btm_ble_gap.cc could be used in bta_dm_act.cc directly.\n\nAnd as John suggested, I tested the CtsBluetoothTestCases module with this change, there are 24 failures:\n```\nSummary (Test executed with 1 devices.)\n-------\narm64-v8a CtsBluetoothTestCases: Passed: 411, Failed: 24, Ignored: 0, Assumption Failed: 74,    \n\n24 tests failed\n---------------\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothConfigTest#testProfileEnabledValue\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothConfigTest#testProfileEnabledValueInList\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothCsipSetCoordinatorTest#testGetGroupUuidMapByDevice\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothCsipSetCoordinatorTest#testGetConnectionState\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothCsipSetCoordinatorTest#testCloseProfileProxy\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothCsipSetCoordinatorTest#testGetAllGroupIds\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothCsipSetCoordinatorTest#testGetDevicesMatchingConnectionStates\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothCsipSetCoordinatorTest#testGetConnectedDevices\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothCsipSetCoordinatorTest#testTestLockCallback\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothCsipSetCoordinatorTest#testLockUnlockGroup\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothLeScanTest#testScanFromSourceWithoutFilters\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothLeScanTest#testBasicBleScan\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothLeScanTest#testScanFromSourceWithFilters\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothLeScanTest#testScanFilter\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothVolumeControlTest#testCloseProfileProxy\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothVolumeControlTest#testGetConnectedDevices\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothVolumeControlTest#testGetConnectionPolicy\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothVolumeControlTest#testGetConnectionState\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothVolumeControlTest#testGetDevicesMatchingConnectionStates\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothVolumeControlTest#testIsVolumeOffsetAvailable\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothVolumeControlTest#testRegisterUnregisterCallback\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothVolumeControlTest#testSetConnectionPolicy\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothVolumeControlTest#testSetVolumeOffset\nandroid.bluetooth.cts.BluetoothVolumeControlTest#testVolumeOffsetCallback\n\n```\nFor details please check the logs here: https://people.linaro.org/~yongqin.liu/logs/CtsBluetoothTestCases.zip\n\nI don\u0027t think they are related to this change, but please help check in case if there is any.",
