      "message": "Hi,\nThere are some known flakiness in the CtsBluetoothTestCases.\n\nI don\u0027t expect any change in this CL to impact the cts.\n\n**BUT**, in the log you linked in the comment, you are running the test as if `LE_AUDIO` and `LE_AUDIO_BROADCAST_ASSISTANT` were supported profiles while your config indicate otherwise:\n\n```\nBluetoothConfigTest (10088 2606)  E    Profile config does not match for profile: LE_AUDIO. Config currently return: true. Adapter support return: 11\nBluetoothConfigTest (10088 2606)  E    Profile config does not match for profile: LE_AUDIO_BROADCAST_ASSISTANT. Config currently return: true. Adapter support return: 11\n```\n\nFor the `BluetoothLeScanTest` it is expected because of this:\n```\nTo run the test, the device must be placed in an environment that has at least 3 beacons, all placed less than 5 meters away from the DUT.\n```\n\n\nfor `BluetoothCsipSetCoordinatorTest` and `BluetoothVolumeControlTest` I assume this should not be enable if the hardware does not support Le_audio",
